.TH ZHEN\-CLAUDE 1 "2026-11-04" "unheaded v0.0.0-20261104150357-41cfe4d85229+dirty" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
zhen\-claude \- ZhenAI's bridge to the Claude API (ADR\-104): a one\-shot prompt or a REPL, every tool call through the Champion gate.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-claude
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
ZhenAI's bridge to the Claude API (ADR\-104): a one\-shot prompt or a REPL, every tool call through the Champion gate.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B confirm
list, approve or deny queued writes (see zhen\-claude confirm \-\-help)
.TP
.B review
review drafts in an agent worktree (see zhen\-claude review \-\-help)
.TP
.B check
standard \-check commands: go, json, cite (see zhen\-claude check \-\-help)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-agent\-root \fISTRING\fR
agent worktrees live under here (env ZHEN_AGENT_WT_ROOT) (default /home/govan/.cache/unheaded/zhen\-worktrees)
.TP
.B \-\-audit\-well
also record every request in the Well's llm_requests and every tool decision in audit_events (DSN from env WELL_OPS_DSN); Well unreachable = read\-only run
.TP
.B \-\-audit\-wotan
also publish the audit records on Wotan (zhen.llm.requests, zhen.audit.toolcalls; HTTP host:port from env WOTAN_ADDR)
.TP
.B \-\-capture \fISTRING\fR
append each turn, redacted, to <dir>/zhen\-capture\-YYYY\-MM\-DD.jsonl; must be outside any repository (env ZHEN_CAPTURE_DIR)
.TP
.B \-\-check \fISTRING\fR
with \-route auto: command (split on spaces, no shell) that gets the local answer on stdin; exit 0 accepts it. Without it only a local failure escalates
.TP
.B \-\-check\-path \fISTRING\fR
path for \-run\-check, relative to the worktree (default .)
.TP
.B \-\-check\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
time limit for \-check (default 1m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-checks \fISTRING\fR
the run_check allowlist (default configs/zhen\-checks.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-config \fISTRING\fR
config file (default $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/unheaded/zhen\-claude.conf; a missing default is fine)
.TP
.B \-\-confirm \fIzhen\-claude confirm approve <id>\fR
what happens to a write the gate refuses pending confirmation: deny (refuse, the default), tty (ask the human on /dev/tty with a code the model never sees), queue (queue it in the Well for zhen\-claude confirm approve <id>; DSN from env WELL_APP_ZHEN_DSN) (default deny)
.TP
.B \-\-daily\-cap\-usd \fINUM\fR
hard spend cap per UTC day in USD (env ZHEN_CLAUDE_DAILY_CAP_USD) (default 5)
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
print the request that would be sent and exit; needs no credentials, sends nothing
.TP
.B \-\-effort \fISTRING\fR
effort: low, medium, high, xhigh, max (default medium)
.TP
.B \-\-family \fISTRING\fR
with \-route auto|local: task family; routes by \-routing (configs/zhen\-routing.yaml) through the threshold router
.TP
.B \-\-ledger \fISTRING\fR
spend ledger file (default $XDG_STATE_HOME/unheaded/zhen\-claude/spend.json)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
max_tokens for the local model (default 1024)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-model \fISTRING\fR
model name sent to the local server (env ZHEN_LOCAL_LLM_MODEL) (default local)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-only
keep this prompt on this host: ask the local model only, never Claude (implies \-route auto without escalation; config local_only)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
time limit for the local model's answer (default 2m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-local\-url \fISTRING\fR
llama\-server base URL for \-route auto (env ZHEN_LOCAL_LLM_URL) (default http://127.0.0.1:8081)
.TP
.B \-\-log\-level \fISTRING\fR
audit log level: debug, info, warn, error (default info)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-iterations \fIN\fR
API calls allowed per turn (tool loop bound) (default 16)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
max_tokens per request (thinking counts toward it) (default 16000)
.TP
.B \-\-mcp\-cmd \fISTRING\fR
MCP stdio server command for \-tools mcp (split on spaces, no shell; the default runs bin/zhen\-mcp, built by make build\-zhen\-mcp) (default scripts/zhen\-mcp.sh)
.TP
.B \-\-mcp\-mutating
also offer the MCP server's mutating tools (file_write, file_patch, runbook_execute); they still go through the Champion gate
.TP
.B \-\-model \fISTRING\fR
Claude model ID (default claude\-opus\-5\-5)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-fallback
disable the server\-side refusal fallback (fallbacks: "default")
.TP
.B \-p \fISTRING\fR
one\-shot prompt (default: read stdin, unless \-repl)
.TP
.B \-\-prices \fISTRING\fR
price table JSON (default: the embedded pkg/claudebridge/prices.json)
.TP
.B \-\-privacy \fISTRING\fR
privacy tier for tool results bound for Claude: standard (redact; summarise large ops output locally) or strict (withhold every Kingdom\-ops result; overnight mode) (default standard)
.TP
.B \-\-project\-root \fISTRING\fR
Champion sandbox root (default: current directory)
.TP
.B \-\-repl
interactive conversation; one line per turn, /quit to leave
.TP
.B \-\-route \fISTRING\fR
claude: send to Claude; auto: ask the local model first, escalate to Claude on failure or a failed \-check (default claude)
.TP
.B \-\-routing \fISTRING\fR
routing table generated by scripts/two\-brains/thresholds.py (default configs/zhen\-routing.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-run\-check \fISTRING\fR
with \-worktree: allowlisted check key (configs/zhen\-checks.yaml) that judges each draft, e.g. go\-test, fixture\-check
.TP
.B \-\-secret\-scanner \fISTRING\fR
secret scanner binary for the privacy tier (gitleaks 8.19+; default: gitleaks on PATH, then ~/.local/bin/gitleaks; env ZHEN_SECRET_SCANNER). Without one nothing is sent
.TP
.B \-\-task\-budget \fIN\fR
advisory task budget in tokens per request (beta; 0 = off, minimum 20000)
.TP
.B \-\-tools \fISTRING\fR
tool providers, comma separated: champion, mcp (or none) (default champion)
.TP
.B \-\-user\-data\-roots \fISTRING\fR
comma\-separated paths whose contents never leave the host (T2, withheld; env ZHEN_USER_DATA_ROOTS)
.TP
.B \-\-worktree \fISTRING\fR
with \-family: the zhen/<name> agent worktree the task works in (drafts are written there)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
